msgstr "Hasige Harimo Ubusa kugira ngo bitahurwe ku buryo bwikora byihuta cyane."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Cacti Table Detection"
msgstr "Itahura ry'Imbonerahamwe za Cacti"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How to tell Cacti-native tables apart from other tables referenced in the slow query log. Defaults to detecting every table with no grouping."
msgstr "Uburyo bwo gutandukanya imbonerahamwe za Cacti n'izindi mbonerahamwe zagaragaye mu nyandiko y'amabaza atinda. Mburabuzi itahura buri mbonerahamwe nta gushyira mu matsinda."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables (no 'OTHER TABLES' grouping)"
msgstr "Tahura imbonerahamwe zose (nta gushyira mu itsinda rya 'OTHER TABLES')"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Use this Cacti Database; group other tables as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Koresha ubu Bubikoshingiro bwa Cacti; shyira izindi mbonerahamwe muri 'OTHER TABLES'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Detect all tables; group tables not in the list below as 'OTHER TABLES'"
msgstr "Tahura imbonerahamwe zose; shyira imbonerahamwe zitari mu rutonde ruri hasi muri 'OTHER TABLES'"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Tables of Interest"
msgstr "Imbonerahamwe Zirebwa"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Only used by the 'Detect all tables; group ... as OTHER TABLES' option above. Please provide a space delimited list of known tables to compare against. In Linux/UNIX, you may obtain a list of tables by using the following command:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>The values of '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', and '<i><b>database</b></i>' are replaced with your values."
msgstr "Bikoreshwa gusa n'ihitamo rya 'Tahura imbonerahamwe zose; shyira ... muri OTHER TABLES' riri haruguru. Nyamuneka tanga urutonde rw'imbonerahamwe zizwi zitandukanyijwe n'umwanya wo kugereranya. Muri Linux/UNIX, ushobora kubona urutonde rw'imbonerahamwe ukoresheje iri tegeko:<br><br> print `mysql -u<i><b>user</b></i> -p<i><b>password</b></i> -e \"show tables\" <i><b>database</b></i> | grep -v Tables_in` | tr '\\n' ' '<br><br>Agaciro ka '<i><b>user</b></i>', '<i><b>password</b></i>', na '<i><b>database</b></i>' gasimbuzwa agaciro kawe."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Upload Limits"
msgstr "Imipaka yo Kohereza Amadosiye"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "File Size upload limits in Cacti."
msgstr "Imipaka y'ingano ya dosiye zoherezwa muri Cacti."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Upload Filesize"
msgstr "Ingano Ntarengwa ya Dosiye Yoherezwa"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum filesize your Apache server will allow to be uploaded is set to the value on the right.  Currently, you can not upload a file larger than this.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> and increase the value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Ingano ntarengwa ya dosiye seriveri yawe ya Apache yemera ko yoherezwa igaragazwa iburyo.  Kuri ubu, ntushobora kohereza dosiye iruta iyi.  Niba ufite inyandiko za MySQL Slow ziruta iyi ngano, ugomba guhindura dosiye ya <i>php.ini</i> ikorana na Apache, ugashaka agaciro ka <b><i>upload_max_filesize</i></b> ukakongera.  Nyuma y'ibyo ugomba kongera gutangiza Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Post Size"
msgstr "Ingano Ntarengwa ya Post"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "The maximum size you can post to the Apache server is set to the value on the right.  If you have MySQL Slow logs larger than this value, you must alter the <i>php.ini</i> file associated with Apache, find the variable <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> and increase its value.  After which you must restart Apache."
msgstr "Ingano ntarengwa ushobora kohereza kuri seriveri ya Apache igaragazwa iburyo.  Niba ufite inyandiko za MySQL Slow ziruta iyi ngano, ugomba guhindura dosiye ya <i>php.ini</i> ikorana na Apache, ugashaka agaciro ka <b><i>post_max_size</i></b> ukakongera.  Nyuma y'ibyo ugomba kongera gutangiza Apache."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Max Execution Time"
msgstr "Igihe Ntarengwa cyo Gukora"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How long (in seconds) this request is allowed to run for; 0 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests, but a web server or reverse proxy in front of PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) can still cut the request off independently - that cannot be detected or overridden from here."
msgstr "Igihe (mu masegonda) iki gisabwa cyemerewe kumara gikora; 0 bisobanura nta mupaka. Uyu mugereka usanzwe ucyongera ukagira nta mupaka ku bisabwa byawo, ariko seriveri y'urubuga cyangwa reverse proxy iri imbere ya PHP (Apache Timeout, Nginx fastcgi_read_timeout/proxy_read_timeout, PHP-FPM request_terminate_timeout) irashobora guhagarika igisabwa ku giti cyayo - ibyo ntibishobora gutahurwa cyangwa guhindurwa uvuye hano."

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Nta mupaka"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "Memory Limit"
msgstr "Umupaka w'Ububiko bw'Igihe Gito"

#: slowlog.php
msgid "How much memory this request is allowed to use; -1 means unlimited. This plugin already raises it to unlimited for its own requests. A very large slow query log being read/imported in a single request can exceed a limited value."
msgstr "Ingano y'ububiko bw'igihe gito iki gisabwa cyemerewe gukoresha; -1 bisobanura nta mupaka. Uyu mugereka usanzwe ubyongera ukagira nta mupaka ku bisabwa byawo. Inyandiko nini cyane y'amabaza atinda isomwa cyangwa yinjizwa mu gisabwa kimwe ishobora kurenza agaciro gafite umupaka."

